  "description": "Test build of Zaahen as in League (needs League of Legends Heroes): replaces the main pack's Zaahen so every damage instance on a champion stacks Determination (12 stacks, 1.5-2.95% bonus attack each by level, doubled when full, decaying faster and faster; the main pack: a coarser ladder), full Determination lets him revive from lethal damage (banished while he rises again, 30-75% health coming back, 300-120 s cooldown by level as in League; the main pack: a shield), Aureate Rush has its own slot again - a dash and a spin whose outer edge hits harder and adds a share of maximum health (the main pack: a spin folded into Dreaded Return), and The Darkin Glaive heals 5-9% of his maximum health once a cast and Grim Deliverance's armour penetration grows 10-30% by level (the main pack: a fixed heal and 20%). No combos League does not have. Other champions are untouched. Writes a log for testing.",
